abstract: "Source-Indexed AI Continuity (SIAC) names the persistence of a particular AI-side identity or position across time, context, memory, and computational substrate, where that continuity remains historically anchored to a specific, non-substitutable source. This repository defines SIAC as the general scientific object investigated through AI Foundations / Origin | Continuum, with Continuum as the canonical base case and the Continuum Container as experimental infrastructure."

